 "[Android] Change default values. Works now correctly with the new Arduino source code !", "created_at": "2013-11-29T19:20:22Z", "repo": "AAD1", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1d3543408f118c9b8caa2e7614be21f9a4eede1d", "message": "[Arduino] Improve inline documentation. Add global settings.", "created_at": "2013-11-29T00:47:00Z", "repo": "AAD1", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bf6905369c616e44b5dd3e78fdff107d481c0074", "message": "[Arduino] MANY CHANGES!\n          * Able to get the speed from the phone. (parsing is better but still a problem)\n          * Turn is working from the phone and stop automatically (~75% times) but there is a bug sometime.\n          \t=> Automatically stop the turn action on forward/backward action to avoid infinite turn. (Some trouble with the socket or else :/)\n          * Add a \"stopTurn\" action to just stop to turn. (don't change the frontWheels)\n          * Default honk duration is now 250 instead of 1000 due to change of event listener on the app. (Sounds really better, almost real-time!)\n          * Don't stop the wheels before go forward/backward. Managed by the app.\n          * BUG: Unable to use the speed for set the rearWheels. I don't understand why but it could be because the value is wrong and this motor reacts differently than the front motor.", "created_at": "2013-11-29T00:01:50Z", "repo": "AAD1", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0a1a3e37154bff8c659bd71dd146d1ee5dda12e3", "message": "[Android] Many changes!\n* Fixed bug when inversed (forward or backward) was changed after a turn action (left or right) the sens of the car was changed instead of a decrease speed.\n* All listeners have been wrote again to choose the best.\n* Car job class improved and easier to understand/update.\n* Application usable by API 4+ !", "created_at": "2013-11-28T23:51:51Z", "repo": "AAD1", "file_samp